      "explanation": "Zn(s) |Zn<sup>2+</sup> (aq)| |M<sup>x+</sup> (aq)| M(s)\n<br>---------------------------------------\n<br>        Anode              Cathode\n<br><br> E<sup>o</sup><sub>cell</sub> = E<sup>o</sup><sub>cathode</sub> – E<sup>o</sup><sub>anode</sub>\n<br><br>(i) For Ag<sup>+</sup>/Ag :\n<br><br>E<sup>o</sup><sub>cell</sub> = 0.80 – (– 0.76) = 1.56 V\n<br><br>No of electrons transferred = LCM of valency factor of two electrode\n<br><br>Valency factor of Zn(s) |Zn<sup>2+</sup> = 2\n<br><br>Valency factor of Ag<sup>+</sup>/Ag = 1\n<br><br>LCM of 1 and 2 = 2\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> No of electrons transferred = 2\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> E<sup>o</sup><sub>cell</sub> per electron = <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.781ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.84ex\" height=\"2.737ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -864.9 1697.2 1209.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.or